From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 12:45:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 020/117] power: supply: bq27xxx: add cache-only transport
 support

Property reads in the BQ27xxx core normally access the bus on demand,
which is unsuitable for timing-sensitive transports that acquire
coherent snapshots.

Add an opt-in cache-only mode with periodic refresh and cached property
errors. Limit it to the supported BQ27545 property subset; existing
transports keep their current polling and direct-read behavior.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: e28258377315947aebb45b8fdf5b287a9a5cbf46
---
 drivers/power/supply/bq27xxx_battery.c | 390 +++++++++++++++++++++++--
 include/linux/power/bq27xxx_battery.h  |  18 ++
 2 files changed, 389 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

